WEBVTT

00:06.510 --> 00:08.860
What does that say?

00:09.760 --> 00:13.990
"A Honki Person is one who finds 
a heart that does not flee."

00:15.650 --> 00:19.170
Does "Honki" mean you're strong 
and a good fighter?

00:19.170 --> 00:23.340
Not just strong, but strong and pure.

00:33.290 --> 00:35.740
What's that thing watching from the back?

00:43.590 --> 00:47.440
It's something that sneaks in through 
the cracks in weak people's hearts.

00:49.840 --> 00:51.590
Being a Honki Person...

00:54.210 --> 00:55.950
means that you never run away.

00:57.010 --> 00:59.210
Never run away...

01:10.650 --> 01:11.930
See you later.

02:51.130 --> 02:53.650
Mahoro-chan!

02:53.650 --> 02:55.940
Sorry I'm so late!

02:53.740 --> 02:58.740
<b>#08  Sad News! Seriously Falling in Love with Gomoku Soba!</b>

02:55.940 --> 02:57.790
I'd rather eat alone.

02:57.790 --> 03:00.950
I know what you mean! 
I hate crowded places so much.

03:02.950 --> 03:05.580
<i>Seriously-falling-in-love gomoku soba!</i>

03:05.890 --> 03:07.220
Old hag.

03:07.220 --> 03:08.420
That looks good!

03:08.420 --> 03:10.500
Huh? Did you seriously fall in love?

03:13.010 --> 03:16.260
I'm sorry I put you in such 
an uncomfortable spot.

03:16.610 --> 03:20.130
It really did hurt me to 
have to fight your brother.

03:20.490 --> 03:24.420
But now, I think your brother will 
be able to retire without regret.

03:24.420 --> 03:27.440
So, Mahoro-chan, will you...

03:27.440 --> 03:29.960
go... g-g-g-go... go out—

03:29.060 --> 03:30.710
Ara-chan!

03:31.660 --> 03:32.600
Ew.

03:32.600 --> 03:34.190
Hey, Jin-san.

03:34.190 --> 03:35.980
Uh... Mahoro-chan?

03:36.920 --> 03:38.490
Let's eat together.

03:38.490 --> 03:40.820
I can't believe you!

03:40.820 --> 03:43.910
Are you gonna take responsibility 
for screwing up my life?!

03:45.010 --> 03:45.980
Huh?

03:47.330 --> 03:50.260
So listen. For my brother's 
welcome-home party...

03:50.260 --> 03:52.680
I was wondering if we could 
do it at your restaurant.

03:53.040 --> 03:53.920
At my place?

03:54.260 --> 03:57.980
He said he wants to stuff his face
 with good food when he gets home.

03:57.980 --> 04:01.270
I'm sure he'd love the gyoza at your place.

04:02.420 --> 04:03.670
Or is that a bad idea?

04:05.090 --> 04:06.680
Nah, it's probably okay.

04:06.680 --> 04:07.890
Really?

04:07.890 --> 04:09.330
Awesome!

04:09.330 --> 04:10.510
Thank you!

04:11.610 --> 04:13.770
We'll have a big feast!

04:13.770 --> 04:17.920
Oh, yeah, a real big feast! Real big feast!

04:16.800 --> 04:19.490
Why the hell do you have to
do it at that guy's place?

04:17.920 --> 04:21.680
Real big feasty feast!

04:19.810 --> 04:22.410
I want my brother to eat some good food.

04:22.410 --> 04:24.230
You're both coming, right?

04:24.230 --> 04:26.020
You bet! You bet!

04:27.030 --> 04:28.960
Well, yeah. I'll be there.

04:31.870 --> 04:36.050
Ken-san, I'd love for you to come 
to my brother's welcome-home party.

04:36.050 --> 04:38.050
<b><b>Attending</b></b>

04:38.050 --> 04:39.760
Thank you very much!

04:39.760 --> 04:42.010
I'm sure my brother will be very happy.

04:42.010 --> 04:46.280
We're doing it! Heave-ho, heave-ho!

04:46.280 --> 04:48.450
Heave-ho, heave-ho!

04:46.280 --> 04:49.000
Shut up, man. What are you 
getting so excited for?

04:49.000 --> 04:53.080
C'mon, it's Matakara's big bro! 
He's gotta be super tough!

04:53.860 --> 04:58.740
I've only met him a few times, but it 
sounds like he's stronger than Ken-san.

04:59.260 --> 05:00.780
Yahoo!

05:00.780 --> 05:04.200
Heave-ho, here we go! Merging time!

05:05.730 --> 05:06.950
Listen, man...

05:07.570 --> 05:10.620
Why do you want to keep 
merging with me, anyway?

05:10.620 --> 05:14.100
W-Well, you know, I just want...

05:15.230 --> 05:19.840
to build a happy family together with you.

05:19.840 --> 05:21.640
I absolutely refuse!

05:19.840 --> 05:22.340
<b>Family Day</b>

05:19.840 --> 05:22.340
<b>A Happy</b>

05:25.590 --> 05:28.270
Hey, don't get so rough, guys!

05:28.740 --> 05:30.520
Always acting like you're the shit.

05:31.640 --> 05:34.650
Please stop! I'm begging you.

05:35.720 --> 05:36.800
Cut it out.

05:37.940 --> 05:39.650
It's Asamine.

05:39.960 --> 05:41.860
At least take him on one at a time.

05:41.860 --> 05:43.160
Huh?

05:43.160 --> 05:46.780
Do you have any idea what 
this asshole put us through?

05:47.700 --> 05:50.740
If you don't stop now, 
then you're fighting me.

05:52.290 --> 05:54.270
Tch. Let's split.

06:02.070 --> 06:03.250
Ouch, ouch, ouch.

06:03.250 --> 06:04.340
Are you all right?

06:05.770 --> 06:08.500
Thank you for helping me.

06:10.830 --> 06:11.700
Okay, then.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.280
I'm very sorry about before!

06:17.280 --> 06:17.980
Huh?

06:17.980 --> 06:20.070
Hey, come on...

06:20.510 --> 06:24.250
Arajin-kun helped me 
realize my own mistakes!

06:24.250 --> 06:28.890
When I faced his true power... 
it almost felt like...

06:29.380 --> 06:31.330
he was a Honki Person.

06:31.330 --> 06:32.830
Huh?

06:32.830 --> 06:35.690
Actually, I tried to become one, too.

06:36.080 --> 06:37.480
A Honki Person.

06:37.480 --> 06:40.050
I'm ashamed to say 
I eventually gave up, though.

06:44.590 --> 06:48.180
I wanted to become a Honki Person, too.

06:48.520 --> 06:52.230
A long time ago, Ara-chan 
and I used to train for it here.

06:52.230 --> 06:55.310
No wonder you two are so tough.

06:56.780 --> 07:00.440
But I couldn't even compare to him.

07:00.440 --> 07:04.300
Even though you trained together? 
Now that sounds odd.

07:04.650 --> 07:07.970
Oh! Unless... I don't know...

07:09.100 --> 07:10.530
What is it?

07:11.340 --> 07:13.620
I might have just figured out

07:14.930 --> 07:16.250
how Arajin-kun got so strong.

07:18.130 --> 07:20.480
This is just between us,

07:21.920 --> 07:25.010
but this temple holds a secret, see?

07:26.210 --> 07:28.010
A secret?

07:30.260 --> 07:33.280
Ah, but maybe it's better if you don't know.

07:33.280 --> 07:35.580
Sorry. Forget I said anything.

07:38.840 --> 07:41.050
Bye, Matakara-kun.

07:44.440 --> 07:47.200
<b>Button Activated</b>

07:48.450 --> 07:50.020
Was that good enough?

07:51.010 --> 07:52.200
Sure.

07:52.560 --> 07:55.240
You're getting revenge 
against Doman Kenichiro,

07:55.240 --> 07:57.060
the man who betrayed you, right?

07:57.530 --> 08:01.710
You and I both hide grudges 
deep within our hearts.

08:02.170 --> 08:04.680
Essentially, we are one and the same.

08:05.890 --> 08:07.180
You don't have to remind me.

08:07.840 --> 08:09.840
<b>Closed tomorrow for private party.
Chu~per sorry!</b>

08:09.840 --> 08:11.720
<b>Third Match - Heavyweight Tag Team</b>

08:09.840 --> 08:11.720
<b>(Champions) Musashi & Toya vs. Daisuke & Hashiguchi</b>

08:11.720 --> 08:13.720
They're gettin' Honki!

08:15.100 --> 08:17.140
So you like pro wrestling now?

08:17.140 --> 08:20.890
Hell no. He makes me put it on.

08:21.650 --> 08:23.870
Looks like they're coming along nicely!

08:23.870 --> 08:26.580
Thank you for letting us 
reserve the whole restaurant.

08:26.580 --> 08:29.540
It's fine, it's fine! 
I'm looking forward to seeing him, too.

08:29.540 --> 08:31.110
So how old is your brother now?

08:31.110 --> 08:32.160
He's 21.

08:32.160 --> 08:33.530
The ideal age!

08:33.530 --> 08:35.290
Go buy your damn ingredients already!

08:35.290 --> 08:37.340
Okay, I'll leave the rest to you chu!

08:40.290 --> 08:43.790
You suck at this. You're squeezing too hard.

08:43.790 --> 08:47.460
You gotta use less filling. Like this.

08:47.970 --> 08:50.180
Ara-chan, you really are good at this!

08:50.180 --> 08:52.420
Don't underestimate the son 
of Chinese restaurant owners.

08:53.540 --> 08:54.970
I'll give it a try.

08:56.900 --> 08:58.690
You get to eat that one.

09:03.370 --> 09:05.740
I made gyoza with my brother once,

09:06.610 --> 09:11.610
but they all got burnt 
and didn't taste good at all.

09:12.010 --> 09:14.170
Your brother sucks at it, too?

09:14.700 --> 09:16.940
Then why don't you teach him?

09:16.940 --> 09:17.860
Huh?

09:18.520 --> 09:20.500
Aren't you gonna live together again?

09:22.130 --> 09:23.030
Yeah.

09:23.500 --> 09:27.060
Once I save up more money, 
we're going to rent an apartment together.

09:27.060 --> 09:29.080
When we do, you gotta come over!

09:29.080 --> 09:31.490
I'm gonna be busy with Mahoro-chan, so no way.

09:31.490 --> 09:33.080
Then bring Jin-san with you!

09:33.080 --> 09:34.450
Not a chance!

09:35.260 --> 09:37.510
<b>Aahar Bath</b>

09:40.100 --> 09:45.360
<b>Brother Comes Home! 2:00 PM</b>

09:57.370 --> 10:00.370
<b>Chu~ Chu~ Chinese Restaurant</b>

10:00.370 --> 10:02.370
<b>Closed today
 for private party.
Welcome home 
to chu!</b>

10:02.370 --> 10:05.630
<b><b>Chu~ Chu~ 
Chinese Restaurant


 Offal Dishes


 Pig Feet  -  Pig Ear</b></b>

10:27.400 --> 10:30.900
<b>Mitsukuni</b>

11:07.940 --> 11:10.690
<b>Chu~ Chu~ Chinese Restaurant</b>

11:35.590 --> 11:37.510
Asamine Matakara-kun?

11:39.130 --> 11:40.780
Yes, that's me.

11:40.780 --> 11:42.830
Right now, Mitsukuni-kun is...

11:53.040 --> 11:54.720
Is Matakara-kun home?

11:55.190 --> 11:57.800
He hasn't come home since yesterday.

11:57.800 --> 11:59.780
And he isn't answering his phone.

12:00.140 --> 12:01.490
Did something happen?

12:02.190 --> 12:05.370
Well, yes. It's his older brother.

12:07.410 --> 12:08.600
Caw!

12:09.010 --> 12:10.170
Caw, caw!

12:10.980 --> 12:12.660
What was up with Matakara?

12:13.250 --> 12:14.090
Hey.

12:14.490 --> 12:15.900
I said hey!

12:17.010 --> 12:19.260
Where would he usually go?

12:19.840 --> 12:23.100
<b>Welcome Home, Mitsukuni</b>

12:20.220 --> 12:23.100
What could have happened to Matakara-kun?

12:23.100 --> 12:27.350
Damn it. If you aren't coming, 
at least let us know!

12:27.690 --> 12:31.240
If you see him at school, tell him 
he's still welcome any time.

12:34.860 --> 12:38.450
Mahoro-chan! I found a totally perfect stone!

12:38.450 --> 12:39.300
Mm.

12:39.300 --> 12:41.790
It's called a lake blue soapstone.

12:41.790 --> 12:43.570
It would be perfect for you!

12:43.570 --> 12:44.550
Mm.

12:44.550 --> 12:48.380
This time I'm gonna carve it 
in a font called seal script.

12:49.180 --> 12:50.870
I need you for a minute.

12:50.870 --> 12:53.170
Um, I'm kinda busy right now.

12:53.170 --> 12:54.840
Come on, don't be shy.

12:54.100 --> 12:54.840
Hey!

12:54.840 --> 12:57.250
Class is about to start!

12:58.420 --> 13:01.140
Huh? Matakara's brother?

13:03.250 --> 13:07.580
There was a fight at juvie. 
He tried to break it up and got stabbed.

13:08.220 --> 13:10.130
They say he isn't gonna make it.

13:12.150 --> 13:15.900
It sounds like Matakara hasn't 
been home since yesterday.

13:15.900 --> 13:19.610
He isn't at the hospital, either. 
You have any idea where he might go?

13:20.710 --> 13:21.830
I don't know.

13:21.830 --> 13:24.160
Maybe somewhere he and his brother used to—

13:23.650 --> 13:25.400
I said I don't know!

13:25.400 --> 13:27.870
You guys know him a lot better than I do!

13:29.310 --> 13:31.670
If we knew, why the hell 
would we be asking you?!

13:31.670 --> 13:34.500
Isn't Matakara supposed to be your buddy?!

13:35.810 --> 13:37.960
No, he's not my buddy.

13:39.570 --> 13:42.650
There's no point in asking 
this asshole. Let's go.

13:43.940 --> 13:47.150
Matakara's probably going 
through hell right now.

13:47.150 --> 13:50.840
Someone he cares so much about, 
ending up like that...

13:52.390 --> 13:53.840
Mahoro-chan?

13:55.900 --> 14:00.460
Those guys hassle me for no reason, 
and now I don't even get to see Mahoro-chan.

14:10.760 --> 14:11.910
Brother...

14:12.920 --> 14:14.520
Tell me this isn't real.

14:15.750 --> 14:16.800
Please...

15:15.450 --> 15:17.030
Matakara-kun!

15:18.230 --> 15:21.170
I heard about your brother. Are you... okay?

15:26.450 --> 15:28.020
Is Ara-chan home?

15:28.470 --> 15:30.590
Yes. Come in.

15:39.490 --> 15:40.570
Ara-chan.

16:09.610 --> 16:10.780
Matakara.

16:11.250 --> 16:14.040
That little punk's got a nasty 
monkey or something on his back.

16:14.630 --> 16:17.770
This temple holds a secret, see?

16:37.130 --> 16:38.730
What is it?

16:47.700 --> 16:49.100
Shindo-san?

16:49.510 --> 16:51.700
You saw that thing, didn't you?

16:53.010 --> 16:57.810
That thing is the only reason 
Arajin-kun got so strong so quickly.

16:57.810 --> 17:01.260
His strength is completely faked! You see?

17:01.260 --> 17:04.000
You're lying! I don't believe that at all!

17:04.000 --> 17:08.340
But you saw it, didn't you? 
There's a creature possessing him.

17:08.340 --> 17:09.780
You're wrong.

17:10.250 --> 17:11.840
Ara-chan is strong!

17:12.640 --> 17:15.560
Arajin isn't a Honki Person at all.

17:15.950 --> 17:17.560
He's been

17:17.930 --> 17:19.890
fooling you this whole time!

17:19.890 --> 17:21.080
You're wrong!

17:29.010 --> 17:30.650
Yeah, but why me?

17:30.650 --> 17:33.250
He wanted to see you for something, right?

17:33.250 --> 17:35.340
Go see him. You're buddies, aren't you?

17:35.340 --> 17:37.120
I told you, he's not my buddy.

17:37.120 --> 17:41.650
But aren't you at least worried about him? 
After what happened to his brother?

17:42.830 --> 17:47.660
You've gotta have some idea, right? 
A memorable spot for him and his brother?

17:47.660 --> 17:49.590
How would I even remember someth—

17:58.350 --> 17:59.560
Matakara.

18:03.110 --> 18:04.500
Ara-chan.

18:04.500 --> 18:07.860
I heard about your brother. You okay?

18:09.160 --> 18:10.860
Weren't you just at my place?

18:11.560 --> 18:13.860
Did you want to talk to me or something?

18:16.130 --> 18:17.950
I saw that thing.

18:18.810 --> 18:21.620
A monster or something came out of you.

18:23.100 --> 18:26.430
But your strength doesn't 
all come from that thing.

18:26.430 --> 18:30.500
That's a lie, right? 
Your strength is for real, right?

18:32.190 --> 18:36.640
I believe in you. I know 
you're stronger than anyone.

18:36.640 --> 18:38.820
And that you'd never run away!

18:42.120 --> 18:44.660
I couldn't tell you this before...

18:46.450 --> 18:50.670
But remember when those older kids 
chased us down and really beat you up?

18:51.680 --> 18:54.900
I know I was too weak then.

18:55.850 --> 19:01.310
That's probably why you didn't want to 
keep training to be Honki People with me.

19:03.190 --> 19:05.790
But I'm gonna keep getting 
stronger and stronger,

19:06.770 --> 19:09.530
so let's start over and keep 
working to be Honki People!

19:09.530 --> 19:10.750
You're wrong.

19:11.160 --> 19:12.220
I...

19:14.550 --> 19:16.510
abandoned you and ran.

19:16.920 --> 19:18.070
Huh?

19:19.480 --> 19:23.060
When I saw you pass out, I ran away.

19:24.070 --> 19:25.270
No way.

19:26.030 --> 19:28.470
There's no way you'd do that, Ara-chan.

19:29.260 --> 19:33.150
I'm not the kind of guy you think I am.

19:33.150 --> 19:35.060
You're lying!

19:35.060 --> 19:38.580
You're strong, Ara-chan! 
I know you'd never run away!

19:38.580 --> 19:40.950
I'm telling you you're wrong!

19:41.480 --> 19:44.870
I'm weak! I ran away because I'm weak!

19:45.160 --> 19:47.870
I was never strong enough to begin with!

19:48.190 --> 19:51.250
Quit pretending I'm someone I'm not!

19:56.030 --> 19:58.580
That thing you saw is called Senya.

19:59.020 --> 20:02.600
I only got stronger because I used his power.

20:03.950 --> 20:07.390
So you were lying to me this whole time?

20:08.050 --> 20:12.020
Even when you told me you wanted 
to become Honki People?

20:13.250 --> 20:19.020
Matakara, I'm not trying to 
become a Honki Person anymore.

20:30.010 --> 20:32.040
Heave-ho!

20:30.930 --> 20:33.090
Ouch! What the hell are you doing?!

20:33.430 --> 20:35.050
You feeling better now?

20:35.050 --> 20:36.400
Huh?

20:39.520 --> 20:41.750
Why would that make me feel any better?

21:06.900 --> 21:08.420
It's okay.

21:08.810 --> 21:10.800
Your worries are over now.

21:11.770 --> 21:13.830
You've suffered enough, haven't you?

21:14.950 --> 21:16.550
So stand up.

21:17.250 --> 21:19.380
Hold this good and tight.

21:19.810 --> 21:23.890
This will release you from your suffering.

23:45.030 --> 23:50.030
<b>Temptation!</b>

23:45.030 --> 23:50.030
<b>Soup-Related Etceteras!</b>

23:45.700 --> 23:48.030
Bucchigi-you again next week!
